{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52223","headline":"颂六十二首 四十八 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 四十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沉痾诚已久，痼疾实难痊。\n四魔恒相娆，六贼竞来牵。\n困厄无人救，惟忻大慈怜。\n遥愍愚心网，振锡远乘烟。\n授兹甘露药，邪见莫能先。\n消灾除业累，拔济苦相煎。\n恩流振玄教，普利该大千。\n自非神咒力，何能益延年。\n（见同书卷七五《杂咒部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}